Provider logos
==============

The SVG files in this directory are the provider marks from the LobeHub
Icons set (https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons), package
@lobehub/icons-static-svg 1.106.0, MIT licensed:

  claude.svg      <- icons/claude-color.svg
  openai.svg      <- icons/openai.svg
  zai.svg         <- icons/zai.svg
  minimax.svg     <- icons/minimax-color.svg
  kimi.svg        <- icons/kimi.svg
  openrouter.svg  <- icons/openrouter.svg

Local edits, so the files render with Fyne's SVG rasterizer: the <title>
element and the inline style were removed, the 1em width/height replaced by
24, and every path's data rewritten with explicit separators (compact arc
flags such as "a5 5 0 110 10" become "a 5 5 0 1 1 0 10", which oksvg cannot
read in the compact form). The shapes are unchanged.

The marks are trademarks of their respective owners. They are used here only
to identify the service a monitor card reports on; AI Monitor is not
affiliated with or endorsed by any of them.

